徒、曲阿立武进县，属毗陵郡；晋改毗陵曰晋陵。刘昫曰：唐苏州昆山县，汉娄县地。复，扶又翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a03f9887-db0e-11ef-8a03-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"劉徵","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘征","people_xingming":"刘征","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a04034f2-db0e-11ef-9e19-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":269,"link_death_year":339,"link_td_description":"郗鉴，字道徽，高平郡金乡县（今山东省济宁市金乡县）人，东晋重要将领、军事家。东汉御史大夫郗虑的玄孙。郗鉴历仕晋元帝、晋明帝、晋成帝三朝，曾协助讨平晋初的王敦之乱和苏峻之乱。","link_td_id":"Q10001455","link_td_number_id":113487,"people_name":"郗鑒","people_name_jianti_auto":"郗鉴","people_xingming":"郗鉴","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a04034f6-db0e-11ef-a723-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","resolved_place_entity_id":98,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a04034f3-db0e-11ef-b1a8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"婁縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"娄县","resolved_place_entity_id":6528,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"a04034f4-db0e-11ef-a42a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武進","place_name_jianti_auto":"武进","resolved_place_entity_id":3260,"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"a04034f5-db0e-11ef-8849-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/五、苏州府（卷二十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宋、齐亦为娄县治，后废。旧《志》：梁置昆山县，在今松江府...","context_before":"...权初，封张昭于此，寻又封陆逊为娄侯。晋亦为娄县，属吴郡。","source_end_index":74,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"7ef75125-ca5d-5f8f-a4e8-c2625eece1ad","source_start_index":51,"source_text":"咸和六年，石勒将刘徵，浮海而南，寇娄县，即此。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/五、苏州府（卷二十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/七、常州府（卷二十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宋大明末，改属南东海郡。齐因之。梁省入兰陵县，属兰陵郡。...","context_before":"...二县地。孙吴改丹徒曰武进。晋太康初，别置武进县属毗陵郡。","source_end_index":75,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2c8153da-d0eb-59ac-86dd-2b924d6becce","source_start_index":49,"source_text":"咸和六年，石勒将刘徵等浮海而南，掠武进，郗鉴击却之。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/七、常州府（卷二十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"1春，正月，趙劉徵復寇婁縣，掠武進，郗鑒擊卻之。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月，后赵刘徵再次进犯娄县，劫掠武进，郗鉴将其击退。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，赵刘征复寇娄县，掠武进，郗鉴击欲之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8113,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a03f9886-db0e-11ef-b1f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2三月，壬戌朔，日有食之。","content_fanyi":"春季三月壬戌朔，发生日食。","content_jianti_auto":"2三月，壬戌朔，日有食之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8114,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"a04034f7-db0e-11ef-9f7e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"石勒","people_name_jianti_auto":"石勒","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a040aa2d-db0e-11ef-8e43-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史言石勒能矯其獷悍之習而脩文。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史言石勒能矫其犷悍之习而修文。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":176,"tongjian_id":"a040aa2c-db0e-11ef-beeb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"司法","official_name":"廷尉","official_note":"廷尉是秦漢至魏晉時期的最高司法官，負責審理案件和刑罰，此處續咸擔任廷尉，向趙主勒進諫反對營建新宮，體現其監察和諫議職能。","official_rank":"九卿之一","source_snippet":"廷尉上黨續咸苦諫","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"93b5775e-198c-4ab8-82f1-9b7493e169da"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中樞機構","official_name":"中書令","official_note":"中書令是中書省的長官，掌管機要文書和詔令起草，在魏晉時期權力逐漸擴大，此處徐光以中書令身份勸諫趙主勒，顯示其參與決策和諫議作用。","official_rank":"正三品或更高","source_snippet":"中書令徐光曰","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"09be4294-b9ea-43e4-9e82-2cd5d547d755"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中央高官","official_name":"列卿","official_note":"列卿泛指朝廷中的高級官員，如九卿等，此處指續咸作為廷尉屬於列卿之一，徐光以此強調其地位重要，不應輕易處斬。","official_rank":"九卿級別","source_snippet":"柰何一旦以直言斬列卿乎","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"cfbd7d54-9d8e-4cb8-8fce-190438408c71"},{"confidence":0.88,"official_category":"中央高官","official_name":"公卿","official_note":"公卿是對三公和九卿等朝廷高級官員的統稱，此處趙主勒下詔要求公卿以下官員推薦人才，體現其行政和選拔職能。","official_rank":"高級官員","source_snippet":"又詔公卿以下歲舉賢良方正","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"02ec8d8b-35f2-4269-b85d-7a528eb94bb8"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":274,"link_death_year":333,"link_td_description":"石勒，字世龙，原名㔨，小字匐勒，上党武乡（今山西榆社）羯人，是五胡十六国时代后赵的开国君主。","link_td_id":"Q10000870","link_td_number_id":69226,"people_name":"勒","people_name_jianti_auto":"勒","people_xingming":"石勒","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"a040aa2e-db0e-11ef-af0b-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[本年五十八岁]"},{"link_td_description":"续咸，字孝宗，上党人，是杜预弟子，以研究春秋、郑氏易和刑法为主，并收数十人为徒。","link_td_id":"Q10021081","link_td_number_id":6997579,"people_name":"續咸","people_name_jianti_auto":"续咸","people_xingming":"续咸","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a040aa2f-db0e-11ef-933b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":274,"link_death_year":333,"link_td_description":"石勒，字世龙，原名㔨，小字匐勒，上党武乡（今山西榆社）羯人，是五胡十六国时代后赵的开国君主。","link_td_id":"Q10000870","link_td_number_id":69226,"people_name":"勒","people_name_jianti_auto":"勒","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"a040aa30-db0e-11ef-861b-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[本年五十八岁]"},{"people_name":"徐光","people_name_jianti_auto":"徐光","people_xingming":"徐光","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"a040aa31-db0e-11ef-aed0-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"续咸，字孝宗，上党人，是杜预弟子，以研究春秋、郑氏易和刑法为主，并收数十人为徒。","link_td_id":"Q10021081","link_td_number_id":6997579,"people_name":"咸","people_name_jianti_auto":"咸","people_xingming":"续咸","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"a040aa32-db0e-11ef-8eaa-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":274,"link_death_year":333,"link_td_description":"石勒，字世龙，原名㔨，小字匐勒，上党武乡（今山西榆社）羯人，是五胡十六国时代后赵的开国君主。","link_td_id":"Q10000870","link_td_number_id":69226,"people_name":"勒","people_name_jianti_auto":"勒","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"a040aa33-db0e-11ef-adad-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[本年五十八岁]"},{"link_td_description":"续咸，字孝宗，上党人，是杜预弟子，以研究春秋、郑氏易和刑法为主，并收数十人为徒。","link_td_id":"Q10021081","link_td_number_id":6997579,"people_name":"咸","people_name_jianti_auto":"咸","people_xingming":"续咸","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"a040aa34-db0e-11ef-b5e8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","resolved_place_entity_id":98,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a040aa35-db0e-11ef-a340-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄴","place_name_jianti_auto":"邺","resolved_place_entity_id":101,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a040aa36-db0e-11ef-a187-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上黨","place_name_jianti_auto":"上党","resolved_place_entity_id":364,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"a040aa37-db0e-11ef-a89f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄國","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄国","resolved_place_entity_id":645,"start_index":171,"tongjian_id":"a040aa38-db0e-11ef-b083-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"3夏，趙主勒如鄴，將營新宮；廷尉上黨續咸苦諫，勒怒，欲斬之。中書令徐光曰：「咸言不可用，亦當容之，柰何一旦以直言斬列卿乎！」勒嘆曰：「爲人君，不得自專如是乎！匹夫家貲滿百匹，猶欲市宅，況富有四海乎！此宮終當營之，且敕停作，以成吾直臣之氣。」因賜咸絹百匹，稻百斛。又詔公卿以下歲舉賢良方正，仍令舉人得更相薦引，以廣求賢之路。起明堂、辟雍、靈臺于襄國城西。","content_fanyi":"夏季，后赵国主石勒前往邺城，准备营建新宫；廷尉、上党人续咸苦苦谏阻，石勒发怒，想将他斩首。中书令徐光说：“续咸的话即使不可采用，也应当宽容他，怎么可以因一时直言就杀掉列卿呢！”石勒感叹道：“身为君主，竟不能这样自行做主吗！平民家产满百匹，还想购买宅第，何况我富有四海呢！这座宫殿终究要营建，姑且下令停止施工，以成全我正直臣子的气节。”于是赐给续咸绢一百匹、稻一百斛。又下诏命公卿以下每年举荐贤良方正，并让被举荐的人可以相互推荐引荐，以广开求贤之路。在襄国城西修建明堂、辟雍、灵台。","content_jianti_auto":"3夏，赵主勒如邺，将营新宫；廷尉上党续咸苦谏，勒怒，欲斩之。中书令徐光曰：「咸言不可用，亦当容之，柰何一旦以直言斩列卿乎！」勒叹曰：「为人君，不得自专如是乎！匹夫家赀满百匹，犹欲市宅，况富有四海乎！此宫终当营之，且敕停作，以成吾直臣之气。」因赐咸绢百匹，稻百斛。又诏公卿以下岁举贤良方正，仍令举人得更相荐引，以广求贤之路。起明堂、辟雍、灵台于襄国城西。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，拓拔宏修礼乐、立明堂，皆是也。败类之儒，鬻道统以教之窃...","context_before":"...肆以护门墙贪利养者；猥贱之术，而为君子者效之，不亦傎乎？","source_end_index":119,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a952d734-25a6-4d4b-8bb0-202ee0bece5c","source_start_index":108,"source_text":"石勒起明堂、辟雍、灵台"}],"title":"七 道统要旨不易窃取"}],"id":8115,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a040aa2b-db0e-11ef-812d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"面对成汉进攻选择投降","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_A040D61BDB0E11EFB4CEA0D3651F611F_01"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"大將軍","official_note":"大將軍是古代高級軍事將領，通常負責統帥軍隊和指揮作戰。在《資治通鑑》此段中，大將軍壽（李壽）率軍進攻陰平和武都，顯示其軍事指揮職能。此信息基於《資治通鑑》原文和歷史常識。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"成大將軍壽攻陰平、武都","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"2259b4aa-1be2-477c-a3fc-e5fda0a38f39"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":300,"link_death_year":343,"link_td_description":"汉昭文帝李寿，字武考，十六国时期成汉政权的皇帝。为李特之弟李骧少子。338年即位后改国号为“汉”。343年病死。","link_td_id":"Q10004440","link_td_number_id":199661,"people_name":"壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"寿","people_xingming":"李寿","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a040d61d-db0e-11ef-9d09-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":334,"link_td_description":"杨难敌，氐人，为4世纪仇池首领之一。","link_td_id":"Q10008653","link_td_number_id":361498,"people_name":"楊難敵","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨难敌","people_xingming":"杨难敌","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a040d61e-db0e-11ef-b7ee-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"成","place_name_jianti_auto":"成","resolved_place_entity_id":12,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a040d61f-db0e-11ef-b797-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陰平","place_name_jianti_auto":"阴平","resolved_