":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"勒死，石虎篡立，复称天王，寻迁于邺，东取令支[今永平府东...","context_before":"...亦来降，进并秦、陇，凉州称藩，于是淮、汉以北，悉为赵境。","source_end_index":651,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"fae31f68-8d78-5c59-86c3-1081b12e630e","source_start_index":625,"source_text":"勒自称赵天王，旋称帝，营邺宫，以洛阳为南都，置行台。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"5九月，趙主勒復營鄴宮；以洛陽爲南都，置行臺。","content_fanyi":"九月，后赵君主石勒重新营建邺宫；将洛阳定为南都，设置行台。","content_jianti_auto":"5九月，赵主勒复营邺宫；以洛阳为南都，置行台。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8117,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a041016c-db0e-11ef-9394-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"禮記，冬祭曰「烝」，史、漢亦作「蒸祭」。餘肉曰胙，今謂之祭福肉。","note_content_jianti_auto":"礼记，冬祭曰「烝」，史、汉亦作「蒸祭」。余肉曰胙，今谓之祭福肉。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"a0410172-db0e-11ef-99a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"齊桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐桓公","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"a0410177-db0e-11ef-911f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"王導","people_name_jianti_auto":"王导","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a0410178-db0e-11ef-8a45-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a0410179-db0e-11ef-855a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a041017a-db0e-11ef-a7f2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_n