侍中冯怀议，以为：「天子临辟雍，拜三老，况先帝师傅；谓宜尽敬。」侍中荀奕议，以为：「三朝之首，宜明君臣之体，则不应敬；若他日小会，自可尽礼。」诏从之。奕，组之子也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8118,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"a0410171-db0e-11ef-8608-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"新昌縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"新昌县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a041760d-db0e-11ef-b726-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"遼東郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"辽东郡","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"a041760e-db0e-11ef-b0fb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"新昌縣，屬遼東郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"新昌县，属辽东郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":156,"tongjian_id":"a041760c-db0e-11ef-bea9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"廆","people_name_jianti_auto":"廆","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a0417611-db0e-11ef-a1d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"侃","people_name_jianti_auto":"侃","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a0417612-db0e-11ef-a55a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"勒","people_name_jianti_auto":"勒","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a0417613-db0e-11ef-8b8f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"石勒","people_name_jianti_auto":"石勒","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"a0417614-db0e-11ef-b430-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"廆加車騎將軍，故侃稱之。官，謂天子；勒，謂石勒也。騎，奇寄翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"廆加车骑将军，故侃称之。官，谓天子；勒，谓石勒也。骑，奇寄翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":211,"tongjian_id":"a0417610-db0e-11ef-90e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_C